      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report on 6 women with ureteral ectopia to emphasize the need for careful endoscopic examination in evaluating the entity. The clinical histories are unusual in that 1 of the 6 patients had classical symptoms of urinary incontinence. A discussion of the diagnosis and treatment of ureteral ectopia in such patients is presented."},
